        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pena de Grama. Rowlet plana silenciosamente em direção aos alvos e, antes que percebam sua presença, começa a atingi-los com chutes violentos. Ele se sente confortável em lugares pequenos e escuros, podendo se acomodar na bolsa ou dentro do casaco de seu Treinador.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Rowlet pode evoluir para Dartrix no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leafage, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Peck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Astonish, Shadow Sneak</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Foresight, Ominous Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Pluck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Fury Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Leaf Blade</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Feather Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Brave Bird, Nasty Plot</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Attract, Brave Bird, Bullet Seed, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Defog, Double Team, Dual Wingbeat, Echoed Voice, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, False Swipe, Feather Dance, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Nasty Plot, Nature Power, Night Shade, Protect, Psycho Cut, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Shadow Claw, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Work Up, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Baton Pass, Confuse Ray, Curse, Defog, Double Team, Haze, Knock Off, Ominous Wind, Roost</p>",
